{"seq":30,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w03520"},"reason":"Question written for the Quiztopia extended deck (an unprinted fact of the card's article).","by":"Quiztopia import","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which six-headed monster, lurking in a cliff cave opposite the whirlpool Charybdis, devoured six of Odysseus' companions?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welches sechsköpfige Ungeheuer, das gegenüber dem Strudel Charybdis in einer Felshöhle lauerte, verschlang sechs Gefährten des Odysseus?"}]},
